    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "84274b97-f587-3e3b-801b-e55605d12f3b",
                "word": "елико",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b936bd0d-a915-3f78-9cda-3b0fc7be5644",
                        "entry_id": "84274b97-f587-3e3b-801b-e55605d12f3b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "старин., церк.-слав. сколько, насколько, сколько-нибудь"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77b76991-0106-490a-bb10-c16642685925",
                                "sense_id": "b936bd0d-a915-3f78-9cda-3b0fc7be5644",
                                "text": "Но надежда, преследуя человека до крайности, нас укрепляла, и мы, елико нам возможно было, ободряли друг друга."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e1cc84df-8d07-4bba-9faa-b12fc01f0157",
                                "sense_id": "b936bd0d-a915-3f78-9cda-3b0fc7be5644",
                                "text": "Всё теперешнее «посвящение в каторжники» состоит в том, что тюрьма старается извлечь из новичка «пользу», то есть, пользуясь его неопытностью, обмошенничать его, елико возможно."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "64e83aba-d3f4-4a47-8075-3e0f3dd5157d",
                        "source_entry_id": "84274b97-f587-3e3b-801b-e55605d12f3b",
                        "source_sense_id": "b936bd0d-a915-3f78-9cda-3b0fc7be5644",
                        "target_lang_word": "as far as",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "as far as",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38d0db9b-2a16-3e60-ad34-a56c69db92ea",
                                        "entry_id": "40917356-5b78-30cb-8d33-b856fae7858e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To the degree or extent that."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "638fd5e1-57e9-46ae-b87d-04154ad403b3",
                                                "sense_id": "38d0db9b-2a16-3e60-ad34-a56c69db92ea",
                                                "text": "as far as the eye can see"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39373c39-4909-45cf-9ca3-1a7cd288b5a1",
                                                "sense_id": "38d0db9b-2a16-3e60-ad34-a56c69db92ea",
                                                "text": "As far as the financing is concerned, there will be no problems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70db906a-00e3-42b1-a666-7e013f0d5c6d",
                                                "sense_id": "38d0db9b-2a16-3e60-ad34-a56c69db92ea",
                                                "text": "As far as the choice makes any difference, I prefer the second option."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40726d0f-6781-4f0e-a831-6f55ed6c2939",
                                                "sense_id": "38d0db9b-2a16-3e60-ad34-a56c69db92ea",
                                                "text": "I'll help you as far as I can."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e6f5e92-1e4c-3702-860e-0c73b17b8c0b",
                                        "entry_id": "40917356-5b78-30cb-8d33-b856fae7858e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used without any completion, usually to imply \\\"to the degree or extent that ... is/are concerned\\\"."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c87c5364-eec0-4667-bd8e-32605474df17",
                                                "sense_id": "7e6f5e92-1e4c-3702-860e-0c73b17b8c0b",
                                                "text": "As far as the policies and procedures under which these companies operate, we keep a very close eye on that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "as far as",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "38ad613e-e5c5-3e80-8ab1-4dda124cbe95",
                                        "entry_id": "7e9e61a6-6f96-3569-808a-a121565d60a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see as, far, as."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "000ff831-a5d9-43df-b4ae-78ba8ab85673",
                                                "sense_id": "38ad613e-e5c5-3e80-8ab1-4dda124cbe95",
                                                "text": "as far as the next town"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "390ec59d-8d70-37d4-b381-198addda2a22",
                                        "entry_id": "7e9e61a6-6f96-3569-808a-a121565d60a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With respect to; as relates to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "proscribed",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3134cde7-7ce4-481c-9fb5-8dd76d520989",
                                                "sense_id": "390ec59d-8d70-37d4-b381-198addda2a22",
                                                "text": "As far as financing, there will be no problems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fad8ffc3-c7a1-4bf1-846d-fe2576ada16a",
                                                "sense_id": "390ec59d-8d70-37d4-b381-198addda2a22",
                                                "text": "As far as food—still no nausea or problems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81c48b02-9f52-43a3-bc81-36a8f23cbbdf",
                                                "sense_id": "390ec59d-8d70-37d4-b381-198addda2a22",
                                                "text": "As far as food, the fire department will have hot dogs and brats."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8e943d1-3617-4c0f-8016-ec8a72928937",
                                                "sense_id": "390ec59d-8d70-37d4-b381-198addda2a22",
                                                "text": "As far as food, Courville had expected to have his pick of barbecue and beef jerky […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "976c6bd1-54d4-4d8a-b31d-361f32d85238",
                                                "sense_id": "390ec59d-8d70-37d4-b381-198addda2a22",
                                                "text": "\"We put a lot of emphasis into the training of our staff, as far as food knowledge, wine knowledge,\" he said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d1ba343-e974-4d56-987d-66d889dd0567",
                        "source_entry_id": "84274b97-f587-3e3b-801b-e55605d12f3b",
                        "source_sense_id": "b936bd0d-a915-3f78-9cda-3b0fc7be5644",
